# 配置同步仓库：行尾规范化
# session_projcache 是 JSON 缓存，跨平台需保持 LF 一致，标记为二进制跳过 CRLF 转换
conversations/session_projcache/*.json binary

# 其余 JSON/JS/PS1/MD 统一 LF
*.json text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf

# 二进制资产不转换
*.tgz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary